  "description": "Syncfusion® ASP.NET Core Image Editor is an interactive control for editing images directly in the browser. It supports cropping, resizing, rotating, flipping, applying filters (brightness, contrast, saturation, hue, blur, opacity), drawing shapes (lines, rectangles, ellipses, arrows), adding text annotations, inserting images, and freehand drawing. It provides undo/redo support, zoom, pan, and image export capabilities, making it ideal for image processing, photo editing, and annotation use cases in ASP.NET Core applications.",
